{"4923360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Books & Blood", "steam_appid": 4923360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horror game</strong> about working in a post-apocalyptic bookstore, searching through the bookshelves to fulfill customer orders, and avoiding the monsters lurking in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Can you check the back?&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your shift by collecting orders from your customers, then venture into the shelves to retrieve the books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/4b0aa66297645c88d4c1ba4bf763d873.poster.avif?t=1788145507\" width=850 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/4b0aa66297645c88d4c1ba4bf763d873.webm?t=1788145507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/4b0aa66297645c88d4c1ba4bf763d873.mp4?t=1788145507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Deeper Sections of the Bookstore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to delve deeper and buy upgrades to increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/fbd498f30ac23524ae4a007d85c40ade.poster.avif?t=1788145507\" width=850 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/fbd498f30ac23524ae4a007d85c40ade.webm?t=1788145507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/fbd498f30ac23524ae4a007d85c40ade.mp4?t=1788145507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Monster Behavior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your strategy to adapt to the different types of monsters you may encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/a62ba030705621c0b91edcb9221b1fd2.poster.avif?t=1788145507\" width=850 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/a62ba030705621c0b91edcb9221b1fd2.webm?t=1788145507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4923360/extras/a62ba030705621c0b91edcb9221b1fd2.mp4?t=1788145507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bookstore Simulation: </strong>Take orders, fetch books, and deliver them to customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Unlock and explore new areas, shortcuts, and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Stay quiet, tread lightly, and you may survive another day. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Monster Types:</strong> Adapt to new challenges when facing multiple types of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Buy upgrades to increase your efficiency and odds of survival.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horror game</strong> about working in a post-apocalyptic bookstore, searching through the bookshelves to fulfill customer orders, and avoiding the monsters lurking in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Can you check the back?&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your shift by collecting orders from you